  id: spore_floater
  displayName: Spore Floater
  description: Drifting marsh creature. Almost like a living lantern. Mostly passive
    but bursts spores when threatened.
  behaviors:
  - Drifts on marsh winds.
  - Releases small spore cloud when touched.
  - Dies easily from any attack.
  - Cluster of floaters lights up marsh paths at night.
